    "body": "Hello, \r\nI am using the latest telegram version and have my online status private (i.e. Last seen recently.), however when in groups, you can still see an estimate of when I was last online.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\nLet's say I was online 5 mins ago, user A was online 4 minutes ago and user B was online 6 minutes ago. On the group users list I will appear between those two users and with that you can see my exact status which is not very private.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n",
